Global execution rules for every phase

## Must always hold
- [ ] Build must succeed before phase is complete
- [ ] All tests must pass before phase is complete
- [ ] No touched file may exceed `300` LOC
- [ ] No hardcoded user-facing strings
- [ ] No hardcoded colors
- [ ] No direct Firebase calls from UI/ViewModel
- [ ] No security relaxations or test-only production bypasses
- [ ] Use `./gradlew` only

## Required final command for every phase
- [ ] `./gradlew check`

## Required handoff before next phase
Provide:
1. Tech debt incurred
2. How it was immediately resolved
3. Confirmation build succeeds and all tests pass

